<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian tin price falls new 27-month low.</title>
<headline>Malaysian tin price falls new 27-month low.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's spot tin price continued its bearish trend, falling to a new 27-month low of 13.52 ringgit ($5.41) a kg on initial high selling despite a higher overnight market in London, traders said.</p>
<p>Tin dropped another four cents from Thursday's close of 13.56 cents a kg.</p>
</text>
